gnome-shell-extension-magic-mirror (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Notice plugged-in monitors: listen to kernel hotplug events and, on X11,
    probe the outputs once with xrandr.
  * Probe the outputs when hovering or clicking a dimmed switch, for drivers
    that send no hotplug events (NVIDIA X11).
  * Add a Refresh displays menu item.

